{"sba-sakura-38848":{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"             ﻿\n \n こんばんは\n \n \n \n GWいかがお過ごしですか？\n \n おうちでのんびりとしている方が多いのかな〜。と。\n \n \n \n ５月５日は子どもの日〜🎏\n \n \n \n \n この前のブログでも触れましたが、\n \n \n ５月５日よる６：４５〜\n くりぃむくいず ミラクル9 2時間SP\n に出演させていただきます〜\n \n \n \n "},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JJ0KCTZQG2D4A440GX1QYNP1","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">\n \n \n \n \n \n \n \n \n \n \n \n \n \n \n \n "},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JJ0KCVZZBB0F003E876Z100M","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">\n \n \n \n \n \n "},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JJ0KCX15RQAYW5SEKVXT7T87","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">\n  \n  \n  \n ゴーちゃん。１０周年おめでとう〜！！🤍\n \n \n \n \n \n \n \n \n "},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JJ0KCY54F83HDZVSSK24H3KK","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">\n  \n  \n  \n  \n  \n  \n  \n みなさん\n きのこの山派？たけのこの里派？\n \n \n \n \n \n \n \n わたしはたけのこの里派！🤍\n \n \n \n \n \n だけど、\n この2人はきのこの山派だといっていた🍄\n \n \n \n \n \n \n \n \n \n またね〜\n \n \n \n \n "},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JJ0KCZ57K4AHQ7318KEFKPEH","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">\n \n \n \n \n \n \n "},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JJ0KD05KY5982SVCG6F73PZA","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">\n  \n  \n  \n  \n こんなわたしもあと３日で２１歳、、、🙃🙃\n \n \n \n \n \n あおい             "}],"source":"archive"},"sba-sakura-50021":{"blocks":[{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"Eve「虎狼来」× GATSBY「METARUBBER」\nコラボレーションムービーが公開されました"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JHH57W46TQBN8SZ1KFVWY5ZC","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"長く愛されているGATSBYさんの広告に、\nこうして携わらせていただけて大感謝です。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JHH57X4ZA9DX6G027Y7JYPR6","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"刺激的な撮影日和"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"身の回りで行われている全てに\n『ホォ...!!!! 』と思わず言ってしまう程\n瞬き禁止のハイセンスだらけの現場で。\n皆さん本当に面白くお優しかったです。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JHH57Y67CPB1X1NH0J0G9BDS","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JHH57Z4PQX3VB1TW9G7QRAAS","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">"},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JHH5803Z13D6BVB2XAWN6JNC","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"車両にいたのは喉が渇いたときだけ🫢\nそれくらいずっと現場観察していました"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そして個人的、\n気になっていたキャスティング理由を\n当日直接お伺いすることができました。\nそのときに頂いたお言葉が本当に嬉しくて..\nアイドルという枠を超えたお仕事\nこれからもっと課題となってくるなと改めて。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"心を込めて携わらせていただいたので\n沢山の皆さんにご覧いただけたら嬉しいな"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"Movie"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"Making"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"2023年4月30日(日)〜2023年5月16日(火)\n渋谷/原宿/大阪/愛知/福岡/北海道にて\nムービー及びグラフィックを用いた\n野外広告も今後展開される予定ですので\n是非お写真撮って行って下さい💙"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ギャツビーメタラバーシリーズで\n一緒に新しい自分のスタイル楽しみましょ〜"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JHH58147AMSHNKR9WD5PJYCC","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">"}],"source":"archive"},"crw-nogi-7868":{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"こんばんは～(*^o^*)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/manatsu.akimoto/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/10/17/8470624/0000.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"はーとだらけにしてみた"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ななみんのBlogのタイトルの"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"キングボンビーってのが"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"何なのか気になってるまなったんです☆"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"明日聞いてみよ♪♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今日は電車に乗ってたら"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ずっと足元から風が吹いてて"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"スカートを抑えるのに"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"必死でした（笑）"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"なんで下から"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"風吹いてるんだろね？（´-`）"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ではQA行っちゃいます(((っ･ω･)っ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"Q.夢があいまいで自衛官になろうか、保育士になろうか、こういう夢に迷った時はどう対処してた？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"A.私は夢に迷った時に無理に"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"決めなきゃっ！て思っても"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"正しい答えを出せないんじゃ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ないかなぁ思って、その"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"なりたい職業について調べてみたり"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"なりたいと思ってるもの以外の"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"職業も調べてみたりして"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"自分の視野を広げたりしてました☆"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今すぐに決まらなくてもたぶん、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"答えを出さなきゃいけない時が"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"きたら"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"自然と、これにしよう！って"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"自信を持って思える時が"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"来ると思いますよ(*^^*)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"Q.まなったんの誕生日と星座まいやんと同じだよ。知っていましたか？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"A.知ってますよ～♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"オーディションの時に"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"誕生日一緒だね！って"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"言ってたの覚えてます(*^o^*)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"Q.夜、寝る直前にすることはなんですか？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"A.携帯の充電"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"なんか現実的（笑）"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"Q.俺かずみん推しなんだけど、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"他のメンバー推しがこうやってコメントしてて、大丈夫かな？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"気分悪くしないかな？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"A.全然気分悪くしないですよっ(*^o^*)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"コメントしてくださるって"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"だけでめちゃくちゃ嬉しいもん♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ありがとうございます( ^ ^ )/"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"Q.オーディションで"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"早い段階から印象に残ってた"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"メンバーは誰？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"A.うーん、結構いろんな"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"メンバーが印象に"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"残ってるんですよね(^o^)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"でも1番は～、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"せっちゃんかな？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"せっちゃんはエントリーNo.が"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"私の一個前で、背が高いし"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"バレエも披露してて圧倒されたので♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"Q.半年間どうやってレッスンしてたんですか？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"A.みんなと一緒に"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"レッスンに参加して、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"私はポジションがまだ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"無かったから横っちょで"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"踊ってましたよ☆"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"だから今は自分のポジションが"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あるってことがすごく嬉しいんです(^-^)♡"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ちょっと短いけど..."},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今日はここまで( ＾0＾)ﾉ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"じゃあ真夏さんは"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"お風呂に入ってきまーす♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"埼玉は雨がすごいです(´ω`；)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"朝も夜も寒いから風邪に"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"気をつけてくださいね(｀・ω・)"}],"source":"archive"},"crw-nogi-22215":{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"こんばんは"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"2014年 今日で終わりますね。\nいつもだけど、今年は特に大晦日って感じしない！\nギリギリまで忙しくさせてもらったからかなぁ\n嬉しいことだっ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今年は今までの中で1番色んなことがあった年でした。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"夏のあいだ休業して、\n戻ってきたとき急にセンターに決まり...\n最初は動揺と不安でいっぱいでしたが\nなまった感覚、慣れない私を\nファンのみなさんやメンバーがぐいぐいと引っ張ってくれました。\n本当に感謝しています。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"来年はそれにお返しできるようにもっと積極的に頑張りたいですし\nどんどん課題を見つけて磨いていきたいです！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そして、映画「超能力研究部の3人」\n山下監督に自分をさらけ出すっていう事を教えてもらった気がします。\n私は普段あまり感情が表に出ないのですが\n初めて心の中にあった思いが口にできた。\nフェイクドキュメンタリーということでしたが\n自分の中では正直設定なんて枠こえて、現実と重なっていました。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"全然知らなかった芝居についてもたくさんダメ出ししてもらって\n悩んで難しいって思ったけど、\nもっと色んな演じ方できるようになりたいって興味が深まりました。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"それから\nミュージカル「虹のプレリュード」\nこの経験は本当に大きかった。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"1からステージでの表現や歌に感情をのせることを学びました。\n役や世界観にのめり込んで感情を爆発させるという体感ができて\nすごいエネルギーとパワーを使ったなぁ。\n千秋楽は涙が止まらなかったよ～"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"また絶対に舞台やりたいです！\nそのためにももっと実力を高めて\nもっと観てる方に伝わるような人間力をつけられるように\n日頃から積み重ねをしたいと思います。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"2014年\n今後の人生でいつ振り返ってもすごい年だったなって感じると思います。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"来年、グループとして特にこれっとあげるとしたら\nライブを頑張りたいです！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"乃木坂はライブをする機会が少ないのですが\n来てくださる方にも満足していただけるようなパフォーマンスをしたいって\n思います。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"個人の目標は\n声量を増やしたいので風船を毎日膨らますのと(効果あるかはわかりません)\n今やっている歩きながらできる英会話の本を続けること！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"飽きっぽい性格なのでここで公言させてもらいました。笑"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"がんばるぞっ\nみなさんの目標は～？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/erika.ikuta/img/erika.ikuta/img/2014/12/31/3173270/0000.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/erika.ikuta/img/erika.ikuta/img/2014/12/31/3173270/0001.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あと年越しまで2時間切った！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"本当にみなさん\n1年間応援してくださりありがとうございました！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"来年もよろしくお願いします☆"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"よいお年を！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"エリカ(。・∀・。)☆彡"}],"source":"archive"},"crw-nogi-31235":{"blocks":[{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/sayuri.inoue/img/blog/sayuri.inoue/img/2016/03/26/0241235/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/sayuri.inoue/img/blog/sayuri.inoue/img/2016/03/26/0241235/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ごめんなさい。ずっと上げたかったブログ、遅くなっちゃいました。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"せいらりん、卒業おめでとう。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"一生の親友"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/sayuri.inoue/img/blog/sayuri.inoue/img/2016/03/26/0241235/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/sayuri.inoue/img/blog/sayuri.inoue/img/2016/03/26/0241235/0003.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/sayuri.inoue/img/blog/sayuri.inoue/img/2016/03/26/0241235/0004.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"『らりにゃんコンビ』！！！"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/sayuri.inoue/img/blog/sayuri.inoue/img/2016/03/26/0241235/0005.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"同い年で、上京組で、青春時代を\nずっと一緒に過ごしてきたらりん、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"色んなことがあったけど\n乃木坂で出会えて本当に良かった"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/sayuri.inoue/img/blog/sayuri.inoue/img/2016/03/26/0241235/0006.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"お互いどんな道に進んでも、\n素敵な大人になろうね！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/sayuri.inoue/img/blog/sayuri.inoue/img/2016/03/26/0241235/0007.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"私の心の変化にすぐに気付いていつも相談にのってくれてたらりん、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"私の誕生日になると、家に押しかけてきて\nピンポン鳴らしまくってたらりん、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"それでいて、誕プレにスナック菓子とかくれるらりん、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"毎年大掃除の季節に、私の家の排水溝を掃除しにきてくれるお母さんみたいならりん、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"何の用もない日に勝手に家にあがりこんできては、\n私のベッドでひたすらゴロゴロしたあと\n何事もなかったかのように帰るらりん"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そんならりんが大好き。（笑）"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"抱きついてきたりキスしてくるらりんは\nちょっと...（笑）"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/sayuri.inoue/img/blog/sayuri.inoue/img/2016/03/26/0241235/0008.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"とにかく、らりんといた毎日が本当に楽しかった！！！"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/sayuri.inoue/img/blog/sayuri.inoue/img/2016/03/26/0241235/0009.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"離れてもまたご飯とか行くし、私の家にも遊びにきてね！\nあと誘ってた温泉もまだ行けてないから行くぞ！笑"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"笑顔と元気を有難う。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"これからも、らりんの笑顔が\nずーっと続きますよーに！！！！"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/sayuri.inoue/img/blog/sayuri.inoue/img/2016/03/26/0241235/0010.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/sayuri.inoue/img/blog/sayuri.inoue/img/2016/03/26/0241235/0011.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"らりにゃんは永遠だ！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/sayuri.inoue/img/blog/sayuri.inoue/img/2016/03/26/0241235/0012.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/sayuri.inoue/img/blog/sayuri.inoue/img/2016/03/26/0241235/0013.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/sayuri.inoue/img/blog/sayuri.inoue/img/2016/03/26/0241235/0014.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"さゆヽ(｡･ω･｡)正義"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/sayuri.inoue/img/blog/sayuri.inoue/img/2016/03/26/0241235/0000.gif","alt":""}],"source":"archive"},"crw-nogi-3512":{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"さん。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"に。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"いち。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"じゃーん。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/misa.eto/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/03/14/1905874/0000.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"つ、ついに 私、衛藤美彩 19歳。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"一年以上伸ばしていた髪を\n肩までバッサリ切りましたよ！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"実は去年の今頃も\nこんなだったんだよな～～。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"初心忘るべからず"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/misa.eto/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/03/14/1905874/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"みなさん.......どうでしょうか"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/misa.eto/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/03/14/1905874/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"//\nきゃー/"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"まいまいと一緒に\n表参道の美容院に行ったよ！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"いや～それにしても\nほんとシャンプー楽だわ(-∀-)"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/misa.eto/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/03/14/1905874/0003.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"髪乾かすのも！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"しかもトリートメントしてもらったから\nサラッサラやし꒰ ︠ु௰•꒱ु"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/misa.eto/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/03/14/1905874/0004.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あ、でも安心してください。\nポニーテールはできる長さなので！笑"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ポニーテールが好きだよって\n言ってくださる方が\nたくさんいるので\nできる長さでってお願いしたの"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/misa.eto/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/03/14/1905874/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"メンバーからは\n幼くなったっち言われた！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"内に巻いたらボブっぽいし\nストレートだとちょっと幼くなって\nくるくる巻いても肩上になって\nって、いろいろとアレンジしやすいから\n自分的には凄く気に入りました(*^^*)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"似合ってるかどうかは別として.."},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/misa.eto/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/03/14/1905874/0005.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"笑"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"17日のチャリティーライブや\n個別握手会等でお会いできた時に\n見かけたときにでも\nぜひ感想を教えてください"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/misa.eto/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/03/14/1905874/0006.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"もちろんコメントでもね(*^^*)！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"それでは今はお仕事おわって\nレッスン向かってるところなので\nレッスン頑張って来まーす"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/misa.eto/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/03/14/1905874/0007.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/misa.eto/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/03/14/1905874/0004.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"17日に向けて....！！！！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"笑顔と元気で\n最高の ライブをお届けすると\n約束します。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"だからレッスンも\n気合い入れて集中してやってきます！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あ、完璧プロフィール第二弾\n近々やるからね～\nみんなのコメント読んで\n参考にさせてもらってるからね！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"いつも本当にありがとう。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ファンのみなさんがいるから。\n力の源～！！元気モリモリ！\nカボスパワ～～！！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"じゃあまた更新しますね"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/misa.eto/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/03/14/1905874/0004.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/misa.eto/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/03/14/1905874/0008.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"※おやすみじゃないから\nおやすみさみさシリーズ書けない\nごめんねほんとに（ ;  ; ）chu！"}],"source":"archive"},"crw-nogi-33351":{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"ちはるーむへようこそ(｡･o･｡)ﾉ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今日はゲリラ豪雨が多かったですね！！\nびっくりした！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"皆さん大丈夫でしたかー？？(> <)\n私は傘持ってたから平気♪\nでもタイミングが良くて、大雨には濡れなかった...！\n驚くべき晴れ女っぷり発揮..."},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/chiharu.saito/img/blog/chiharu.saito/img/2016/07/14/0620529/0000.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"雨の日って、なんでこんなに瞼が重くなるんだろう〜\nお家でお昼寝したくなるよね♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"右上に、さりげなく見えてるのは\nそう、くまごろー。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/chiharu.saito/img/blog/chiharu.saito/img/2016/07/14/0620529/0001.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"相変わらず場所は取るけど\nお家に馴染んでるよ〜♡"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"-------------------------♡"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"コーナー募集の結果です(﹡ˆ ˆ﹡)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"集計してみて多かったやつや、\n私がやりたい！と思ったやつを\nピックアップしてみました〜♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"\\\\コーナー//"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"火曜日  ＊質問返し"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"木曜日  ＊#chihashot"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"土曜日  ＊ファッション or メイクコーナー"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"日曜日  ＊イチオシの食べ物コーナー"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"こんな感じのローテーションに\nなると思います♪！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"毎日コーナーにしようかと思ったんだけど、\nそれじゃ固定化されちゃうな〜と(> <)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"コーナーが全て！メイン！っていう訳じゃないんだけど\n毎日のブログも、少し変化があったほうが楽しいかな〜と思いまして。。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"コーナーが固定されていない日は\n今まで通りの感じにしたり、\n惜しくもコーナー化にならず...！\nというコーナー達をひっぱり出して\n急に企画始めたりするかも♡"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"という感じなので皆さん宜しくね♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今日は○○コーナーの日だ！楽しみ！！\nまた1週間頑張ろう！\nって思ってもらえるような\n楽しいコーナーに出来るように\n頑張るからね\\( ˆ ˆ )/"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"-------------------------♡"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/chiharu.saito/img/blog/chiharu.saito/img/2016/07/14/0620529/0002.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"めーちゃんと♡"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"有難いことに、15th握手会\n3会場が完売いたしましたヽ(；；)丿"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"本当にありがとうございます。\n楽しい時間を過ごしましょう♡"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"15thシングル、残りの会場は"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"・10月29日(土曜日) 幕張メッセ\n・11月6日(日曜日) ポートメッセ名古屋\n・11月13日(日曜日) パシフィコ横浜"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"になってます！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"まだまだ先になるから、\n中々予定も立てられないと思うし\n5部だから遠征とかはキツイかもしれないけど..."},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"私は皆さんと幸せな時間を過ごしたいので\n皆さん待ってます\\( ˆoˆ )/"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"話す内容はブログに提案したりするので\n心配しなくても大丈夫だよ〜！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"連番とかも毎回楽しいので、\nお友達を引き連れてきてくれたら\nすごい嬉しいです♡"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"-------------------------♡"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"さっそく！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"本日の #chihashot"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/chiharu.saito/img/blog/chiharu.saito/img/2016/07/14/0620529/0003.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"これから夏になって\n入道雲が出てくると思うから\nシャッターチャンス逃さないぞ！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"♬ ChihaMusic"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"「高嶺の花子さん」back numberさん"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"最近さらにback numberさんが\n私の中でブームすぎる。\nこの曲はback numberさんを好きになる\nきっかけの曲なんだ〜\nMVも可愛くて、曲を聴くと\nMVも一緒に思い出す♡"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"おやすみ〜♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"斎藤ちはる"}],"source":"archive"}}